{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302510","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302510","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130251001:1":{"text":"굉장히 많지. 온순한 카멜로수스라든지, 플레임 오키드로 빚은 술이라든지...","source_cn":"那太多了。温顺的驮兽，用炽焰兰酿的酒……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D47A87C97347724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130251002:1":{"text":"그리고 타진 냄비도 있어! 이 냄비에 멧돼지 고기와 플레임 오키드를 끓이면 물을 넣을 필요도 없더군!","source_cn":"还有塔啫锅！用这种锅来炖野猪肉和炽焰兰时，你甚至都不用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88FB8A56E42F3E76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130251003:1":{"text":"삼각형 모양의 높은 뚜껑에 맺힌 플레임 오키드 즙이 그대로 고기에 스며드니까!","source_cn":"炽焰兰的汁水会在它独特的三角形高盖帽上凝结，再浸入野猪肉中！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E00016EAA4D7842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130251004:1":{"text":"...아무래도 타진 냄비를 몇 개 더 사야겠어.","source_cn":"……或许我们可以考虑再购买一些塔啫锅。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AB0746433D86028","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人尼古莱":{"text":"상인 니콜라이","source":"商人尼古莱","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}